From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0007] Fix AI anti-spoofing class ordering

The anti-spoof-mn3 model defines class 0 = real, class 1 = spoof.
The code had the check inverted (spoof_cls == 0), causing a hand to be accepted as real.
Fix to spoof_cls == 1.

diff --git a/auth/face/antispoofing/face_as.cc b/auth/face/antispoofing/face_as.cc
index 151e246..98d0af6 100644
--- a/auth/face/antispoofing/face_as.cc
+++ b/auth/face/antispoofing/face_as.cc
@@ -71,5 +71,5 @@ SpoofResult FaceAntiSpoofing::inference(const ImageRGB& image) {
 
   int spoof_cls = argmax(logits, 2);
   float score = logits[spoof_cls];
-  return SpoofResult(score, spoof_cls == 0 && score >= this->threshold);
+  return SpoofResult(score, spoof_cls == 1 && score >= this->threshold);
 }
